      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Orgone (Reichian) therapy, which utilizes a unique physical approach in addition to standard character-analysis, is illustrated in cases of muscle contraction (tension) headache. It offers a more direct technique for attacking the muscular tension (somatic armor) while undermining the psychic defenses."},
